+### §viewport-media-query — the shell's layout step follows the viewport (replaces §container-not-viewport)
+- Since: 2026-10-22
+- Decision: the shell's layout step uses a viewport `@media (min-width: 720px)` query, not an `@container` query.
+- Override: the maintainer explicitly overrode §container-not-viewport (since 2026-09-15, which required `@container`
+  queries on `.shell` and forbade viewport `@media` width queries) on 2026-10-22.
+- Known trade-off: the shell still renders inside split panes as narrow as 380px on a 1440px screen. There the
+  viewport query picks the two-column layout, which is what clipped the sidebar in incident 2026-09-14.
